# Investigation Reports

## Location

**`docs/investigation/<topic-slug>.md`**.

## Required Sections

1. Question
2. Summary
3. Key Findings
4. APIs Involved
5. Flow Diagram
6. Call Flow
7. Code Pointers
8. Snippets
9. Reproduction Scenarios
10. Log Analysis (omit if no logs)
11. Files Involved
12. Assumptions
13. Gaps and Open Questions

## Ownership

`code-investigator` creates/updates. Others may link, not rewrite, unless asked.
